<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Wanaparthy | Insured Shifting TG-33 Telangana
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I book Bike Transportation In Wanaparthy with Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking is simple: visit our website, enter your pickup address (e.g., Palace Road, Rajiv Gunj Market), select the bike model, and receive an instant quote. You can also call our 24‑hour support line to schedule a doorstep pickup. Once confirmed, our team arrives with the hydraulic ramp trailer, verifies the bike, and secures it for transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging include for my two‑wheeler?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer shield combines 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, custom wooden crates, anti‑vibration pads, and a final sealing tape. Each layer is designed to absorb impacts, prevent rattling, and guard against moisture, ensuring your bike arrives without any scratches or dents.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my bike fully insured during the Wanaparthy to hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance, providing full declared‑value protection against loss, theft, or damage. In the unlikely event of a claim, you simply submit the GST invoice, e‑Way bill, and incident report; our claims team processes reimbursements within five business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the pre‑loading audit prevent damage to my bike?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Before loading, our trained supervisors conduct a four‑point audit: a visual condition check of the bike, verification of chassis locks, integrity testing of the rigid crate, and cross‑checking of all transport documents. Any discrepancy triggers immediate corrective action, guaranteeing that the bike is perfectly secured before it enters the container.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike transport by train or road from Wanaparthy?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For road shipments, you need a valid GST invoice, e‑Way bill, and IBA‑approved mover code certificate. If you opt for rail parcel, the IRCTC bike parcel form, a copy of your ID, and the same GST invoice are mandatory. Our team prepares all paperwork to ensure smooth customs and carrier clearance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the transit from Wanaparthy to major transport hubs take and which routes are used?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The journey covers approximately 850 km via National Highway arterial corridors and multi‑axle express freight highways, typically completed in 12‑14 hours of driving time, plus scheduled rest stops. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress, and our dedicated logistics team ensures timely delivery to any major hub across Telangana and beyond.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there extra charges for doorstep pickup in remote areas of Wanaparthy?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard pickup within the core zones (Palace Road, Rajiv Gunj Market, Kothakota Road, Pebble Colony) is included in the quoted price. For locations beyond these zones, a nominal surcharge covers additional travel time and fuel. The exact amount is disclosed upfront in the instant quote, so there are no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
